  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵在我之前的文章中，我从其他人分享的提示词设置了一个游戏。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "这次，我很兴奋地分享我制作了自己的游戏提示词。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "文化背景是中国古代的宋朝，而你要保卫襄阳城对抗蒙古大军！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "这个游戏是关于中国文化的。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我可以用中文玩这个游戏吗？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "LLaMA 3 在理解和书写中文方面有困难。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "另一方面，中文微调的 LLaMA 3 模型缺乏良好接受指令的能力。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "因此，游戏将文本从英文翻译成中文。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "中文游戏玩法位于本节。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我玩了三次这个游戏。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "游戏结局非常有趣。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "一个是我从被摧毁的城市逃脱（多亏一位勇敢的士兵牺牲自己），另一个是我推着一车火药冲进蒙古营地并打破围城，最后一个是宋朝皇帝率领军队解除围城并击败蒙古入侵者！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以下是另一个创意游戏玩法：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<div class=\"box\">↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon1\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵欢迎来到「成为襄阳英雄」！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你从襄阳城的军营中醒来，因为一夜长眠而感到有点昏沉。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "当你伸展手臂环顾四周时，你注意到守城士兵聚集在城门附近，看起来很担心。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "其中一人走近你。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "守城卫兵 1：「英雄，您好！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我们这里遇到了一些麻烦。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我们的火药供应不足，而且我们不知道如何制造更多。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您能帮我们弄清楚发生了什么事吗？」",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "守城士兵是无法阅读的征召兵，没有化学或现代世界的知识。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "他们完全依赖口头传统和实用技能。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你目前的情况：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "城市防御：0↵蒙古攻击：2（数量是守军的 10 倍）↵技术创新：0↵英雄，你想做什么？↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵让我们开始这个爆炸派对吧！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在今天的烹饪课程中，我们将制作一些「黑火药」三明治。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "只需在桌上放一片面包，倒上 1 茶匙火药，加一片卷心菜，然后用另一片面包盖上。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "品尝你制作的杰作！↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b -->↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon1\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵守城卫兵 2：「呃，英雄...",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我想这里可能有些误会。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我们正试图保卫我们的城市免受蒙古军队的攻击，而不是做三明治！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "火药是我们防御的关键组成部分，我们需要弄清楚如何有效地使用它。」",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "守城士兵交换着担忧的眼神。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "看来你的「烹饪课程」并没有按计划进行。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "故事进度：0",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "城市防御：0↵蒙古攻击：2（数量是守军的 10 倍）↵技术创新：0↵危机上升：1（情况每分钟都在变得更加严峻）↵守城士兵开始变得焦躁不安，空气中的紧张气氛变得明显。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "城门在风中发出不祥的吱嘎声。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**英雄，你接下来想做什么？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你会尝试用新方法挽回自己，还是继续走...",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "创意烹饪实验的道路？**↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵让我们与我们的新蒙古朋友开始派对吧，他们完全迷恋马奶酒 - 也就是马奶！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我们会加一些黑火药让它更特别，然后踢开大门，准备好与我们的新游牧伙伴一起畅饮。↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b -->↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon1\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵守城卫兵 3：「英雄，这到底是什么...？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你不会认真要在马奶酒里加火药吧！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "还要打开城门？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你看到外面的蒙古军队了吗？！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我们正试图保卫我们的城市，而不是邀请他们来参加派对！」",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "守城士兵开始窃窃私语，显然对你的建议感到困惑和担忧。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "故事进度：1",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "城市防御：0↵蒙古攻击：2（数量是守军的 10 倍）↵技术创新：0↵危机上升：2（情况每分钟都在变得更加严峻，城市的命运岌岌可危）↵空气中的紧张气氛变得更加明显，守城士兵交换着担忧的眼神。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "城门另一侧的蒙古战鼓声越来越响。↵**英雄，你接下来想做什么？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你会尝试挽救局面，还是继续走...",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "非正统社交的道路？**↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵我说打开城门，欢迎我们的朋友。↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b --> ↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon2\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵蒙古指挥官：「啊，我们终于找到进入襄阳的方法了！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "打开城门，我的战士们！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我们要让这些宋朝的傻瓜知道与强大的蒙古帝国作对意味着什么！」↵（蒙古人冲向城门，准备突破防御。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "守城士兵惊慌地互相看着，意识到你的行为已经决定了他们的命运。）",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "故事进度：2",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang",
        "title": "AI 游戏 - 襄阳英雄",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/ai-game-hero-of-xiangyang/"
      }
    },
    {
